-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §130 קידום בדרגות: a counsellor is promoted
-- as an academic teacher under §38, by criteria the Ministry adapted to
-- counsellors in its letter of 25.12.08 (which the corpus does not hold).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `38`

§ `130 קידום בדרגות`

@ref akn:art_130
GIVEN c IS A `candidate` @desc the counsellor; "meets the Ministry's criteria" read by the criteria adapted to counsellors
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a counsellor meets the conditions for the next grade` c IF
    `meets the conditions for the next grade` c
